    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        83.188232421875,
        243.32847595214844,
        96.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "Provision of IPT as indicated.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        86.86013793945312,
        91.36740112304688,
        94.86013793945312
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        105.188232421875,
        291.5364990234375,
        118.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "Referral for CPT and ART as indicated.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        108.86013793945312,
        91.36740112304688,
        116.86013793945312
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        127.188232421875,
        513.4520874023438,
        140.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "Counselling on nutritional needs of infants or young children and other affected",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        130.86013793945312,
        91.36740112304688,
        138.86013793945312
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        143.18475341796875,
        186.00099182128906,
        156.5362548828125
      ],
      "text": "family members.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        165.188232421875,
        513.4406127929688,
        178.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "Health facilities should refer to and arrange for appointments with identified services",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        168.86013793945312,
        91.36740112304688,
        176.86013793945312
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        181.18475341796875,
        405.37493896484375,
        194.5362548828125
      ],
      "text": "and community resources before the family leaves the facility.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        204.84869384765625,
        202.37539672851562,
        221.57669067382812
      ],
      "text": "Community support",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        228.58819580078125,
        513.3915405273438,
        241.939697265625
      ],
      "text": "The usual approach to managing TB in children has been specialized care delivered at",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        244.584716796875,
        513.3801879882812,
        257.93621826171875
      ],
      "text": "health care facilities. However, not all people with TB require referral for hospital-based",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        260.58123779296875,
        513.4603271484375,
        273.9327392578125
      ],
      "text": "investigations and care. Decentralization and delivery of care at the community level,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        276.5777587890625,
        513.4261474609375,
        289.92926025390625
      ],
      "text": "when appropriate and available through an integration of family and child services, has",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        292.57427978515625,
        212.2063751220703,
        305.92578125
      ],
      "text": "the following advantages:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        317.09210205078125,
        513.3483276367188,
        330.443603515625
      ],
      "text": "All family members requiring care for TB can receive them at the same time and in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        320.7640075683594,
        91.36740112304688,
        328.7640075683594
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        333.0885925292969,
        181.5504913330078,
        346.4400939941406
      ],
      "text": "the same place.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        355.09210205078125,
        449.3165283203125,
        368.443603515625
      ],
      "text": "Both time and money are saved when care is provided closer to home.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        358.7640075683594,
        91.36740112304688,
        366.7640075683594
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        377.09210205078125,
        513.3716430664062,
        390.443603515625
      ],
      "text": "There is continuity of care between the patient’s home, community and local health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        380.7640075683594,
        91.36740112304688,
        388.7640075683594
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        393.0885925292969,
        138.5290069580078,
        406.4400939941406
      ],
      "text": "centre.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        415.09210205078125,
        513.4406127929688,
        428.443603515625
      ],
      "text": "Community support is increased, which may lead to better adherence to treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        418.7640075683594,
        91.36740112304688,
        426.7640075683594
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        431.0885925292969,
        513.3946533203125,
        444.4400939941406
      ],
      "text": "and can be instrumental in overcoming barriers to long-term care, including",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        447.0850830078125,
        513.3947143554688,
        460.43658447265625
      ],
      "text": "treatment adherence, transportation costs, and loss of wages during sickness and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        463.0125732421875,
        180.90650939941406,
        476.4330749511719
      ],
      "text": "(13) clinic visits  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        485.0810852050781,
        513.4292602539062,
        498.4325866699219
      ],
      "text": "It is also important to involve local schools, assisting them through education of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        501.07757568359375,
        513.41748046875,
        514.4290771484375
      ],
      "text": "teachers and other staff about the needs of children with TB/HIV, the necessity for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        517.0740356445312,
        513.4521484375,
        530.425537109375
      ],
      "text": "frequent visits to clinics and the importance of taking drugs regularly. This may help to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        533.070556640625,
        513.3944702148438,
        546.4220581054688
      ],
      "text": "reduce stigma in schools. Additionally, because not all children have the opportunity to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        549.0670776367188,
        513.3945922851562,
        562.4185791015625
      ],
      "text": "attend school, faith-based organizations and other strong community groups could be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        565.0635375976562,
        366.6315002441406,
        578.4150390625
      ],
      "text": "involved in supporting children with TB and their families.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        600.455078125,
        94.37739562988281,
        617.3110961914062
      ],
      "text": "R",
